"meditation.compassion.detailed_description" = "Treat yourself with the same kindness, understanding, and patience you would naturally offer a dear friend. This self-compassion practice reduces harsh self-criticism, cultivates inner warmth, and strengthens your self-esteem and emotional resilience over time.";
"meditation.focus_clarity.detailed_description" = "Train your mind like a muscle by repeatedly bringing attention back to a single focal point. This mental exercise strengthens your concentration capacity, reduces distractions, improves decision-making clarity, and enhances your ability to maintain sustained focus.";
